g-logged-in-10 h-[3.75rem]" data-v-c051a2cc><ul class="container flex m-auto" data-v-c051a2cc><!--[--><li class="relative" data-v-c051a2cc><a href="/en" class="inline-block p-5 leading-4 text-white-500 theme-logged-in:text-blue-500 hover:text-white-500 hover:bg-blue-700 theme-logged-in:hover:bg-logged-in-100 h-[3.75rem]" data-matomo-category="Header" data-matomo-action="Menu" data-matomo-name="Home" data-v-c051a2cc>Home</a></li><li class="relative" data-v-c051a2cc><a href="/en/news" class="inline-block p-5 leading-4 text-white-500 theme-logged-in:text-blue-500 hover:text-white-500 hover:bg-blue-700 theme-logged-in:hover:bg-logged-in-100 h-[3.75rem]" data-matomo-category="Header" data-matomo-action="Menu" data-matomo-name="News" data-v-c051a2cc>News</a></li><li class="relative" data-v-c051a2cc><a href="/en/wanted" class="inline-block p-5 leading-4 text-white-500 theme-logged-in:text-blue-500 hover:text-white-500 hover:bg-blue-700 theme-logged-in:hover:bg-logged-in-100 h-[3.75rem]" data-matomo-category="Header" data-matomo-action="Menu" data-matomo-name="Wanted" data-v-c051a2cc>Wanted</a></li><li class="relative" data-v-c051a2cc><a href="/en/missing" class="inline-block p-5 leading-4 text-white-500 theme-logged-in:text-blue-500 hover:text-white-500 hover:bg-blue-700 theme-logged-in:hover:bg-logged-in-100 h-[3.75rem]" data-matomo-category="Header" data-matomo-action="Menu" data-matomo-name="Missing" data-v-c051a2cc>Missing</a></li><li class="relative" data-v-c051a2cc><a href="/en/topics" class="inline-block p-5 leading-4 text-white-500 theme-logged-in:text-blue-500 hover:text-white-500 hover:bg-blue-700 theme-logged-in:hover:bg-logged-in-100 h-[3.75rem]" data-matomo-category="Header" data-matomo-action="Menu" data-matomo-name="Topics" data-v-c051a2cc>Topics</a></li><li class="relative" data-v-c051a2cc><a href="/en/contact" class="inline-block p-5 leading-4 text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-500 bg-white-500 h-[4.0625rem] border-white-alternative-500 theme-logged-in:border-white-500 border-b-[.3125rem] relative" data-matomo-category="Header" data-matomo-action="Menu" data-matomo-name="Contact" data-v-c051a2cc>Contact</a></li><!--]--></ul></nav></header><!--]--><span></span><!----><main id="main-content" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-0 bg-white-500 pt-8 gap-y-12"><!--[--><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div class="mb-12 grid-cols-1 !gap-y-0 wide lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-8"><h1 data-testid="title" class="col-span-12 mb-4 title">Contact</h1><p data-testid="introduction" class="col-span-12 p-intro">Contact the Netherlands Police by phone, in a police station, or using a contact form. We do not have email addresses that are available to the general public.</p><div class="overflow-hidden html-block" data-testid="html" data-v-2147862e><h2>If you are in the Netherlands:</h2>

<h3>Emergency:</h3>

<ul>
 <li>Emergency number: <a href="tel:112">112</a> (free of charge)</li>
</ul>

<h3>Non-emergency (questions or make an appointment):</h3>

<ul>
 <li>Local police: <a href="tel:09008844">0900-8844</a>*</li>
 <li>Report Crime Anonymously: <a href="tel:0800-7000">0800-7000</a> (free of charge)</li>
 <li>Fill in the police&#8217;s <a href="/en/form/contact/contactform.html" data-type="internal">contact form</a>, so we can contact you.&#160;</li>
</ul>

<p><em>* Calls will cost 2 cents per minute plus your phone company&#39;s access charge.&#160;</em></p>

<h3>Tips for police investigations:</h3>

<ul>
 <li>The WantedHotline: <a href="tel:0800-6070">0800-6070</a> (free of charge)</li>
 <li>National Criminal Intelligence Unit (NCIE): <a href="tel:+31-79-3458999">+31 79-3458 999</a></li>
</ul>

<h3>Police station:</h3>

<p>Fill in your location on <a href="https://www.politie.nl/mijn-buurt" data-type="external">this page</a>&#160;(in Dutch) to find the nearest police station.</p>

<h2>If you are abroad:</h2>

<p>Call us at: <a href="tel:+31-343-57-8844">+31-343 57 8844</a></p>

<h2>Social media</h2>

<p>For non-urgent questions you can also reach us on social media.&#160;<br />
Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/politie">@Politie</a>. Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/politie">Politie Nederland</a>.</p>

<h2>File a complaint</h2>

<p><a href="/contact/file-a-complaint.html" data-type="internal">Complaints, r&#233;clamations, beschwerdeverfahren</a></p>

<h2>Press</h2>

<p>For journalists only:<br />
Find a spokesperson <a href="https://www.politie.nl/contact/woordvoering" data-type="external">here</a>.</p></div></div></div><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></main><div id="mopinionEmbedded"></div><!----><footer data-testid="footer" class="text-theme-primary-color border-t-[1px] border-theme-background-alt pt-12 bg-white-500"><div class="container px-5 mx-auto"><div data-testid="footer__center" class="flex flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-2 align-center"><div data-testid="footer__center__important-info" class="flex flex-col gap-4 mx-auto mb-12"><div data-testid="footer__center__social" class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 md:grid md:grid-cols-2"><h2 class="sr-only">Social media channels</h2><!----><!--[--><a data-testid="footer__center__social__item" class="flex content-center text-theme-primary-color" href="https://www.facebook.com/politie/" data-matomo-category="Footer" data-matomo-action="Social Media" data-matomo-name="Facebook"><img src="https://www.politie.nl/politie2018/assets/images/social-icons/facebook.svg" alt="" class="w-[42px] min-w-[42px]" aria-hidden="true"><span class="items-center font-bold sr-only md:not-sr-only md:ml-4 md:flex">Facebook</span></a><a data-testid="footer__center__social__item" class="flex content-center text-theme-primary-color" href="https://x.com/Politie" data-matomo-category="Footer" data-matomo-action="Social Media" data-matomo-name="X"><img src="https://www.politie.nl/politie2018/assets/images/social-icons/x-footer.svg" alt="" class="w-[42px] min-w-[42px]" aria-hidden="true"><span class="items-center font-bold sr-only md:not-sr-only md:ml-4 md:flex">X</span></a><a data-testid="footer__center__social__item" class="flex content-center text-theme-primary-color" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/2857644/" data-matomo-category="Footer" data-matomo-action="Social Media" data-matomo-name="LinkedIn"><img src="https://www.politie.nl/politie2018/assets/images/social-icons/linkedin.svg" alt="" class="w-[42px] min-w-[42px]" aria-hidden="true"><span class="items-center font-bold sr-only md:not-sr-only md:ml-4 md:flex">LinkedIn</span></a><a data-testid="footer__center__social__item" class="flex content-center text-theme-primary-color" href="https://www.youtube.com/user/politie" data-matomo-category="Footer" data-matomo-action="Social Media" data-matomo-name="YouTube"><img src="https://www.politie.nl/politie2018/assets/images/social-icons/youtube.svg" alt="" class="w-[42px] min-w-[42px]" aria-hidden="true"><span class="items-center font-bold sr-only md:not-sr-only md:ml-4 md:flex">YouTube</span></a><a data-testid="footer__center__social__item" class="flex content-center text-theme-primary-color" href="https://www.instagram.com/politie" data-matomo-category="Footer" data-matomo-action="Social Media" data-matomo-name="Instagram"><img src="https://www.politie.nl/politie2018/assets/images/social-icons/instagram.svg" alt="" class="w-[42px] min-w-[42px]" aria-hidden="true"><span class="items-center font-bold sr-only md:not-sr-only md:ml-4 md:flex">Instagram</span></a><!--]--></div></div><div data-testid="footer__center__important-info" class="flex flex-col gap-4 mx-auto mb-12"><!--[--><div><div data-testid="footer__center__important-info__item" class="flex flex-col text-center md:text-left"><a class="mt-0 mb-1 font-bold text-h1" href="tel:112" data-matomo-category="Footer" data-matomo-action="Telefoonnummer" data-matomo-name="112" aria-label="Call 1 1 2">112</a><span class="caption">When every second counts</span></div></div><div><div data-testid="footer__center__important-info__item" class="flex flex-col text-center md:text-left"><a class="mt-0 mb-1 font-bold text-h1" href="tel:0900 - 8844" data-matomo-category="Footer" data-matomo-action="Telefoonnummer" data-matomo-name="0900 - 8844" aria-label="Call 0 900 8 8 4 4">0900 - 8844</a><span class="caption">General number for police</span></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div data-testid="footer__links" class="flex flex-col mb-12 align-center"><!----><!--