lenEnabled":16,"searchTypes":88,"matomoAnalyticsEnabled":16},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.politie.nl\u002Fanalytics","1","\u002Fpolitie2018\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Flogo.svg","7ZqDwkGFy0S2nd1TXpNNaIOKXugMV6Qhp3lv1jsh","nieuws,gezocht,vermist,onderwerp,blog,overig",{"$ref":90},"\u002Fpage\u002Fu39a7cf12b24c4a0c859943169d31bcc1",{"$ref":92},"\u002Fpage\u002Fu3e77c2a6d72442ca8fd4a5c5cb2b21d1",{"u39a7cf12b24c4a0c859943169d31bcc1":94,"u3e77c2a6d72442ca8fd4a5c5cb2b21d1":126,"uc69ff2cb63ff4e11987d440e5cc14ebc":147,"ub4435e40ea4545bbad54cc30394a0911":165,"udc73db0f266d472fbb26298a9fb34705":185,"u142a96e47fac4918a67acefaa2bc71bc":204,"uc81840fa2bff4195bcdab53177a4a09e":223,"ua3246c98b9564367971139f46d158753":234,"u3aff63a78991468eab5b4b894e68a358":243,"ub8b42fc2a1664ecfaffc9900f551d920":254,"u9dd6cb1fb6a043d3b1088606818e0aaa":266,"u61613e6d416643efb792be679760fa97":273,"u957f4c9c0643409da494e718e21b1e8d":285,"u9e2feade63d84e42a0d1bb05842f2849":319,"u3f2813470ba24e1e80c9be63c10596c6":380,"u381bc5d9a6a24983b0ce310836719df7":395,"u344e7343886c42bdbe6c564abbbbbe27":401,"u3dd03d47737a4375ac89c92a6e19af69":469,"ua50bb603699c4591b3a55474ff375d68":480},{"id":95,"links":96,"meta":99,"name":104,"type":105,"componentClass":106,"children":107},"r92",{"self":97},{"href":98,"type":77},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.politie.nl\u002Fen\u002Fheadless-api\u002Fcontact?_hn:type=component-rendering&_hn:ref=r92",{"definitionId":100,"params":101},"hst:pages\u002Falgemeen.page",{"path":102,"botName":103},"settings\u002Fchatui-tonen-op","chatui","algemeen.page","component","nl.politie.common.components.LayoutDesktopComponent",[108,110,112,114,116,118,120,122,124],{"$ref":109},"\u002Fpage\u002Fuc69ff2cb63ff4e11987d440e5cc14ebc",{"$ref":111},"\u002Fpage\u002Fub4435e40ea4545bbad54cc30394a0911",{"$ref":113},"\u002Fpage\u002Fudc73db0f266d472fbb26298a9fb34705",{"$ref":115},"\u002Fpage\u002Fu142a96e47fac4918a67acefaa2bc71bc",{"$ref":117},"\u002Fpage\u002Fuc81840fa2bff4195bcdab53177a4a09e",{"$ref":119},"\u002Fpage\u002Fua3246c98b9564367971139f46d158753",{"$ref":121},"\u002Fpage\u002Fu3aff63a78991468eab5b4b894e68a358",{"$ref":123},"\u002Fpage\u002Fub8b42fc2a1664ecfaffc9900f551d920",{"$ref":125},"\u002Fpage\u002Fu9dd6cb1fb6a043d3b1088606818e0aaa",{"type":127,"links":128,"meta":130,"data":131},"document",{"site":129},{"href":79,"type":80},{},{"name":132,"displayName":133,"titel":134,"introductie":135,"tekst":136,"formulierLink":139,"metaDescription":135,"contentBlokken":140,"gerelateerdeVragenDto":139,"gerelateerdeVragen":141,"contentType":142,"secure":63,"enterpriseFormulier":139,"formConfirmFeedback":139,"formIntroFeedback":139,"formFeedback":139,"infoDesk":139,"attachmentInfodesk":63,"attachmentOntvanger":63,"beperkendeVragen":139,"hasFormulier":63,"preferredFormIntroFeedback":139,"localeString":62,"type":143,"lastModifiedDate":144,"sortableDate":145,"publicatieDatum":145,"id":146},"contactlanding","Contactlanding","Contact","Contact the Netherlands Police by phone, in a police station, or using a contact form. We do not have email addresses that are available to the general public.",{"contentType":137,"value":138},"hippostd:html","\u003Ch2>If you are in the Netherlands:\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\u003Ch3>Emergency:\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\u003Cul>\n \u003Cli>Emergency number: \u003Ca href=\"tel:112\">112\u003C\u002Fa> (free of charge)\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Ful>\n\n\u003Ch3>Non-emergency (questions or make an appointment):\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\u003Cul>\n \u003Cli>Local police: \u003Ca href=\"tel:09008844\">0900-8844\u003C\u002Fa>*\u003C\u002Fli>\n \u003Cli>Report Crime Anonymously: \u003Ca href=\"tel:0800-7000\">0800-7000\u003C\u002Fa> (free of charge)\u003C\u002Fli>\n \u003Cli>Fill in the police&#8217;s \u003Ca href=\"\u002Fform\u002Fcontact\u002Fcontactform.html\" data-type=\"internal\">contact form\u003C\u002Fa>, so we can contact you.&#160;\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Ful>\n\n\u003Cp>\u003Cem>* Calls will cost 2 cents per minute plus your phone company&#39;s access charge.&#160;\u003C\u002Fem>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\u003Ch3>Tips for police investigations:\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\u003Cul>\n \u003Cli>The WantedHotline: \u003Ca href=\"tel:0800-6070\">0800-6070\u003C\u002Fa> (free of charge)\u003C\u002Fli>\n \u003Cli>National Criminal Intelligence Unit (NCIE): \u003Ca href=\"tel:+31-79-3458999\">+31 79-3458 999\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fli>\n\u003C\u002Ful>\n\n\u003Ch3>Police station:\u003C\u002Fh3>\n\n\u003Cp>Fill in your location on \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.politie.nl\u002Fmijn-buurt\" data-type=\"external\">this page\u003C\u002Fa>&#160;(in Dutch) to find the nearest police station.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\u003Ch2>If you are abroad:\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\u003Cp>Call us at: \u003Ca href=\"tel:+31-343-57-8844\">+31-343 57 8844\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\u003Ch2>Social media\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\u003Cp>For non-urgent questions you can also reach us on social media.&#160;\u003Cbr \u002F>\nTwitter: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Ftwitter.com\u002Fpolitie\">@Politie\u003C\u002Fa>. Facebook: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.facebook.com\u002Fpolitie\">Politie Nederland\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\u003Ch2>File a complaint\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"\u002Fcontact\u002Ffile-a-complaint.html\" data-type=\"internal\">Complaints, r&#233;clamations, beschwerdeverfahren\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\n\n\u003Ch2>Press\u003C\u002Fh2>\n\n\u003Cp>For journalists only:\u003Cbr \u002F>\nFind a spokesperson \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.politie.nl\u002Fcontact\u002Fwoordvoering\" data-type=\"external\">here\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>",null,[],[],"politie2018:contentdocument","contentdocument",1790943267005,1790943272355,"3e77c2a6-d724-42ca-8fd4-a5c5cb2b21d1",{"id":148,"links":149,"meta":152,"name":155,"type":105,"componentClass":156,"children":157,"models":160},"r92_r1",{"self":150},{"href":151,"type":77},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.politie.nl\u002Fen\u002Fheadless-api\u002Fcontact?_hn:type=component-rendering&_hn:ref=r92_r1",{"params":153},{"isCo